## Context

Scope overflow recorded by verify-gate on PR #16 (ticket 0007). Narrowing the blind `except` in
`fetch_crossref.get_metadata` (0007 Action 2) dropped the implicit guard against a Crossref JSON body
that is not a dict: it raised `AttributeError` instead of returning `None`. PR #16 restores that
behaviour with an explicit type check and a regression test (`tests/test_naming.py`, commit 37d033e).

## Exit criteria
- [x] `get_metadata` returns `None` for a non-dict JSON body, covered by a test
